ed cost\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eCorrelation\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/thead\u003e" }, { "kind": "DIFF_LINE_KIND_ADDED", "newNumber": 14, "text": "        \u003cthead\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth\u003eCompleted\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eOutcome\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eSafe reason\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eProvider\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eTokens\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eEstimated cost\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eProvider response\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eCorrelation\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/thead\u003e" }, { "oldNumber": 15, "newNumber": 15, "text": "        \u003ctbody\u003e" }, { "oldNumber": 16, "newNumber": 16, "text": "        @foreach (var entry in Model.Entries)" }, { "oldNumber": 17, "newNumber": 17, "text": "        {" } ] }, { "oldStart": 20, "oldCount": 7, "newStart": 20, "newCount": 9, "header": "@@ -20,7 +20,9 @@", "lines": [ { "oldNumber": 20, "newNumber": 20, "text": "                \u003ctd\u003e@entry.Provider ┬╖ @entry.Model ┬╖ @entry.Region" }, { "oldNumber": 21, "newNumber": 21, "text": "                    @if (entry.ProviderStatusCode.HasValue) { \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cspan class=\"sub\"\u003eHTTP @entry.ProviderStatusCode ┬╖ @(entry.ProviderFinishReason ?? \"no finish reason\")\u003c/span\u003e }" }, { "oldNumber": 22, "newNumber": 22, "text": "                \u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e@entry.InputTokens in / @entry.OutputTokens out@if (entry.ReasoningTokens \u003e 0) { \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cspan class=\"sub\"\u003e@entry.ReasoningTokens reasoning\u003c/span\u003e }\u003c/td\u003e" }, { "kind": "DIFF_LINE_KIND_REMOVED", "oldNumber": 23, "text": "                \u003ctd\u003e@entry.EstimatedCost.ToString(\"N6\")\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003e@entry.CorrelationId\u003c/code\u003e@if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(entry.ProviderRequestId)) { \u003cbr /\u003e\u003ccode\u003e@entry.ProviderRequestId\u003c/code\u003e }\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e" }, { "kind